menu "Message Router"

    config MSG_ROUTER_BUF_SIZE
        int "Routing ring buffer size (bytes)"
        default 8192
        range 512 65536
        help
            Size of the FreeRTOS ring buffer that queues frames between all
            interfaces. Holds a small header plus the payload per frame.

    config MSG_ROUTER_SINK_QUEUE_SIZE
        int "Per-sink delivery queue size (bytes)"
        default 4096
        range 256 16384
        help
            Each registered sink gets its own ring buffer of this size. The
            routing task pushes frames into it non-blocking; when a sink is
            slow and its queue fills, new frames to THAT sink are dropped
            (drop-newest) so other sinks and producers are never blocked.

    config MSG_ROUTER_SINK_TASK_STACK
        int "Per-sink delivery task stack (bytes)"
        default 3072
        range 1024 8192
        help
            Stack for each sink's dedicated delivery task (one task per
            registered sink).

    config MSG_ROUTER_STATS_PERIOD_MS
        int "Drop-stats log period (ms)"
        default 30000
        range 0 3600000
        help
            How often to log cumulative per-interface drop counters (central
            buffer drops per source + per-sink queue drops per destination).
            Only logs when a counter changed since the last log. Set to 0 to
            disable the periodic log -- counters are still kept and readable on
            demand via msg_router_log_stats().

endmenu
